/Title (Most enterprise GenAI efforts never reach production. Research puts the figure at 95%, and the failure point is rarely the technology. It is implementation strategy: the wrong workflows, unclear governance, no way to measure value. \(Source: MIT NANDA, The GenAI Divide: State of AI in Business 2025.\))
